 style="height:auto;width:100%" data-testid="blox-card"><div class="CardHeader_CardHeaderCtn__mGuOf CardHeader_Card-Text-20__QQqX5 FAQCard_cardHeadingCls__4XVWK  squarebx rightPos" data-testid="card-header"><div class="CardHeader_CardHeaderTitle__GzXgr CardHeader_CardHeaderTitlePrimary__vjpXN gheader"><h2 class="text_Htitle__vsNcm CardHeader_Card-Text-20__QQqX5 FAQCard_cardHeading__Y4AcV"><div class="undefined  " data-testid="text-custom">Frequently Asked Questions</div></h2></div></div><div class="Accordian_accordion__RA0cu FAQCard_faqaccordian__mHVRX"><div class="Accordian_accordionTitle__aUov_ FAQCard_title__Dcjuh Accordian_accordionBorderWeb__oM0ZX  FAQCard_closedAcc__v_xws"><div class="Accordian_titleWrapper__y5bxu"><h3 class="text_Htitle__vsNcm FAQCard_FAQTextDesktop__fUtXz"><div class="undefined  text_text-16px__yyDjQ" data-testid="text-custom">When is the possession date for Acme Avenue?</div></h3></div><div class="Accordian_imageWrapper__BrwaT FAQCard_iconbackground__NBD3A Accordian_LightWrapper__Pja0h "><img alt="arrow-down-secondary" decoding="async" data-testid="next-image-ctn" loading="lazy" width="16" height="16" data-nimg="1" class="" style="color:transparent" src="/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg"/></div></div><div class="Accordian_accordionContent__lzyb_ FAQCard_accordianContent__ZY7na undefined"><div class="FAQCard_FAQTextDesktop__fUtXz">Possession date of Acme Avenue is 30 Dec 2021</div></div></div><div class="Accordian_accordion__RA0cu FAQCard_faqaccordian__mHVRX"><div class="Accordian_accordionTitle__aUov_ FAQCard_title__Dcjuh Accordian_accordionBorderWeb__oM0ZX  FAQCard_closedAcc__v_xws"><div class="Accordian_titleWrapper__y5bxu"><h3 class="text_Htitle__vsNcm FAQCard_FAQTextDesktop__fUtXz"><div class="undefined  text_text-16px__yyDjQ" data-testid="text-custom">What is the RERA carpet area range of Acme Avenue?</div></h3></div><div class="Accordian_imageWrapper__BrwaT FAQCard_iconbackground__NBD3A Accordian_LightWrapper__Pja0h "><img alt="arrow-down-secondary" decoding="async" data-testid="next-image-ctn" loading="lazy" width="16" height="16" data-nimg="1" class="" style="color:transparent" src="/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg"/></div></div><div class="Accordian_accordionContent__lzyb_ FAQCard_accordianContent__ZY7na undefined"><div class="FAQCard_FAQTextDesktop__fUtXz">The RERA carpet area range for Acme Avenue is 642 - 1056 sqft</div></div></div><div class="Accordian_accordion__RA0cu FAQCard_faqaccordian__mHVRX"><div class="Accordian_accordionTitle__aUov_ FAQCard_title__Dcjuh Accordian_accordionBorderWeb__oM0ZX  FAQCard_closedAcc__v_xws"><div class="Accordian_titleWrapper__y5bxu"><h3 class="text_Htitle__vsNcm FAQCard_FAQTextDesktop__fUtXz"><div class="undefined  text_text-16px__yyDjQ" data-testid="text-custom">What is the price range of Acme Avenue?</div></h3></div><div class="Accordian_imageWrapper__BrwaT FAQCard_iconbackground__NBD3A Accordian_LightWrapper__Pja0h "><img alt="arrow-down-secondary" decoding="async" data-testid="next-image-ctn" loading="lazy" width="16" height="16" data-nimg="1" class="" style="color:transparent" src="/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg"/></div></div><div class="Accordian_accordionContent__lzyb_ FAQCard_accordianContent__ZY7na undefined"><div class="FAQCard_FAQTextDesktop__fUtXz">The price range of Acme Avenue is ₹1.07 Cr - 1.65 Cr</div></div></div><div class="Accordian_accordion__RA0cu FAQCard_faqaccordian__mHVRX"><div class="Accordian_accordionTitle__aUov_ FAQCard_title__Dcjuh Accordian_accordionBorderWeb__oM0ZX  FAQCard_closedAcc__v_xws"><div class="Accordian_titleWrapper__y5bxu"><h3 class="text_Htitle__vsNcm FAQCard_FAQTextDesktop__fUtXz"><div class="undefined  text_text-16px__yyDjQ" data-testid="text-custom">Where is Acme Avenue located?</div></h3></div><div class="Accordian_imageWrapper__BrwaT FAQCard_iconbackground__NBD3A Accordian_LightWrapper__Pja0h "><img alt="arrow-down-secondary" decoding="async" data-testid="next-image-ctn" loading="lazy" width="16" height="16" data-nimg="1" class="" style="color:transparent" src="/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg"/></div></div><div class="Accordian_accordionContent__lzyb_ FAQCard_accordianContent__ZY7na undefined"><div class="FAQCard_FAQTextDesktop__fUtXz">Acme Avenue is located at Ambedkar Rd, Kandivali, Charkop, Ambedkar Nagar, Kandivali West, Mumbai, Maharashtra 400067.</div></div></div><div class="Accordian_accordion__RA0cu FAQCard_faqaccordian__mHVRX"><div class="Accordian_accordionTitle__aUov_ FAQCard_title__Dcjuh Accordian_accordionBorderWeb__oM0ZX  FAQCard_closedAcc__v_xws"><div class="Accordian_titleWrapper__y5bxu"><h3 class="text_Htitle__vsNcm FAQCard_FAQTextDesktop__fUtXz"><div class="undefined  text_text-16px__yyDjQ" data-testid="text-custom">What configurations are available in Acme Avenue?</div></h3></div><div class="Accordian_imageWrapper__BrwaT FAQCard_iconbackground__NBD3A Accordian_LightWrapper__Pja0h "><img alt="arrow-down-secondary" decoding="async" data-testid="next-image-ctn" loading="lazy" width="16" height="16" data-nimg="1" class="" style="color:transparent" src="/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg"/></div></div><div class="Accordian_accordionContent__lzyb_ FAQCard_accordianContent__ZY7na undefined"><div class="FAQCard_FAQTextDesktop__fUtXz">Acme Avenue has 2 BHK, 3 BHK configurations.</div></div></div><div class="Accordian_accordion__RA0cu FAQCard_faqaccordian__mHVRX"><div class="Accordian_accordionTitle__aUov_ FAQCard_title__Dcjuh Accordian_accordionBorderWeb__oM0ZX  FAQCard_closedAcc__v_xws"><div class="Accordian_titleWrapper__y5bxu"><h3 class="text_Htitle__vsNcm FAQCard_FAQTextDesktop__fUtXz"><div class="undefined  text_text-16px__yyDjQ" data-testid="text-custom">What is the status of Acme Avenue?</div></h3></div><div class="Accordian_imageWrapper__BrwaT FAQCard_iconbackground__NBD3A Accordian_LightWrapper__Pja0h "><img alt="arrow-down-secondary" decoding="async" data-testid="next-image-ctn" loading="lazy" width="16" height="16" data-nimg="1" class="" style="color:transparent" src="/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg"/></div></div><div class="Accordian_accordionContent__lzyb_ FAQCard_accordianContent__ZY7na undefined"><div class="FAQCard_FAQTextDesktop__fUtXz">The status of Acme Avenue is Ready to move.</div></div></div><div class="Accordian_accordion__RA0cu FAQCard_faqaccordian__mHVRX"><div class="Accordian_accordionTitle__aUov_ FAQCard_title__Dcjuh Accordian_accordionBorderWeb__oM0ZX  FAQCard_closedAcc__v_xws"><div class="Accordian_titleWrapper__y5bxu"><h3 class="text_Htitle__vsNcm FAQCard_FAQTextDesktop__fUtXz"><div class="undefined  text_text-16px__yyDjQ" data-testid="text-custom">Which amenities are provided in Acme Avenue?</div></h3></div><div class="Accordian_imageWrapper__BrwaT FAQCard_iconbackground__NBD3A Accordian_LightWrapper__Pja0h "><img alt="arrow-down-secondary" decoding="async" data-testid="next-image-ctn" loading="lazy" width="16" height="16" data-nimg="1" class="" style="color:transparent" src="/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg"/></div></div><div class="Accordian_accordionContent__lzyb_ FAQCard_accordianContent__ZY7na undefined"><div class="FAQCard_FAQTextDesktop__fUtXz">The amenities are Gymnasium, Indoor Games, Jogging / Cycle Track, Kids Play Areas / Sand Pits, Large Green Area, Spa, Swimming Pool.</div></div></div><div class="Accordian_accordion__RA0cu FAQCard_faqaccordian__mHVRX"><div class="Accordian_accordionTitle__aUov_ FAQCard_title__Dcjuh Accordian_accordionBorderWeb__oM0ZX  FAQCard_closedAcc__v_xws"><div class="Accordian_titleWrapper__y5bxu"><h3 class="text_Htitle__vsNcm FAQCard_FAQTextDesktop__fUtXz"><div class="undefined  text_text-16px__yyDjQ" data-testid="text-custom">Who is the developer of Acme Avenue?</div></h3></div><div class="Accordian_imageWrapper__BrwaT FAQCard_iconbackground__NBD3A Accordian_LightWrapper__Pja0h "><img alt="arrow-down-secondary" decoding="async" data-testid="next-image-ctn" loading="lazy" width="16" height="16" data-nimg="1" class="" style="color:transparent" src="/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg"/></div></div><div class="Accordian_accordionContent__lzyb_ FAQCard_accordianContent__ZY7na undefined"><div class="FAQCard_FAQTextDesktop__fUtXz">The developer of Acme Avenue is Acme Group.</div></div></div></div></section><section id="Developer"><div class="DeveloperInfo_DevInfo__z4GBW DeveloperInfo_Darktheme__ON7C5" data-testid="blox-DeveloperInfo"><h2 class="text_Htitle__vsNcm DeveloperInfo_cardHeading__SkJEX squarebx"><div class="undefined  text_desktop-heading-3__6qV5j" data-testid="text-custom">About The Developer</div></h2><div class="GridCont_gridCont__rn4P3  GridCont_row__HRG7b GridCont_center__7YNM7" style="grid-gap:20px;justify-content:flex-start"><div class="DeveloperInfo_DevlogoBox__pRcPe"><img alt="Developer for Acme Avenue:Acme Group" loading="lazy" width="50" height="50" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="DeveloperInfo_DevLogo__mXnC6" style="color:transparent" src="https://cdn.blox.xyz/builders/thumb/241221043544-Acme.png"/></div><h2 class="text_Htitle__vsNcm DeveloperInfo_cardHeading__SkJEX"><div class="undefined  text_desktop-heading-4__YAMBJ" data-testid="text-custom">Acme Group</div></h2></div><div class="undefined DeveloperInfo_DevText__0bBIr text_text-14px__aPnkg" data-testid="text-custom">Founded in 1976, the Acme Group has emerged as a leading force in Mumbai&#x27;s real estate landscape, distinguished for crafting exceptional residential and commercial projects. The group&#x27;s philosophy centers on creating not just houses but homes that reflect thoughtful design, offering recreational spaces and incorporating nature&#x27;s elements.
 Over the past four decades, Acme has left its indelible mark on the cityscape, adorning Mumbai with nearly a hundred landmarks, while continuing to develop 7.5 million square feet of projects at present. Each Acme project bears testimony to their unwavering commitment to excellence, executed with the highest standards of craftsmanship.</div></div></section><div data-testid="same-area-prop-ctn"><div class="SameAreaProperties_SameAreaPropertiesCtn__qfNU_ Card_primary__IiLET Card_BloxCard__LQ6Yv" style="height:auto;width:auto" data-testid="blox-card"><div class="CardHeader_CardHeaderCtn__mGuOf CardHeader_Card-Text-20__QQqX5 SameAreaProperties_CardHeader__EDw78" data-testid="card-header"><div class="CardHeader_CardHeaderTitle__GzXgr CardHeader_CardHeaderTitleSecondary__w6GWM gheader"><h2 class="text_Htitle__vsNcm CardHeader_Card-Text-20__QQqX5 "><div class="undefined  " data-testid="text-custom">Properties In The Same Area</div></h2></div><div class="CardHeader_CardIconCtn__IwxSE "><img alt="bloxsquare" decoding="async" data-testid="next-image-ctn" loading="lazy" width="16" height="16" data-nimg="1" class="" style="color:transparent" src="/assets/icons/bloxsquare.svg"/></div></div><div><div class="swiper Swiper_SwiperCtn__bi0fK SameAreaProperties_SwiperClass__tmPO8"><div class="swiper-wrapper"><div class="swiper-slide Swiper_SwiperSlide__BWsJ2 SameAreaProperties_SwiperSliderClassName__IpLlP"><div class=" PropertyCard_PropertyCardCtn__yVyLN " data-testid="propertycard-ctn" style="width:296px;height:480px"><a class="HiddenLinksSEO" href="/projects/shree-gopaldham"></a><img alt="Property-Image" decoding="async" data-testid="next-image-ctn" loading="lazy" data-nimg="fill" class=" PropertyCard_PropertyCardImage__9Zvsn" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" src="https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/je-vee-infrastructure-shree-gopaldham-elevation-1762949548.jpg"/><div class="PropertyCard_PropertyDataCtn__eihK5 PropertyCar